    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d831">

                <pb facs="0879" n="780" sameAs="frus:frus1936v02/pg780"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">852.60/20: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Barcelona</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Perkins</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                            State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Barcelona</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-12-02T18:00:00+00:00">December 2, 1936—6
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received December 2—5:15 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>My despatches Nos. 88 of October 31, 93 of November 5, and 121 of November
                        21.<anchor n="7" xml:id="d831-f1"/> Catalan Council of Economy has announced
                    that detailed regulations will shortly appear for the collectivization of
                    businesses containing foreign interests and that meanwhile all activities
                    looking to the collectivization of such businesses should be suspended.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Perkins</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
